    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p29_b10",
      "text": "derived from Anthropic HH-RLHF [Bai et al., 2022]; Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct as the initial\npolicy [Qwen Team, 2024a,b]; OpenAssistant DeBERTa-v3 reward models as proxies\n[He et al., 2021, OpenAssistant, 2023a,b]; and the Tasksource DeBERTa-v3-large RLHF\nreward model as the held-out evaluator [Sileo, 2023]. We do not redistribute modified\ndatasets or model checkpoints; URLs and implementation details are provided in the\nrepository and Section G.\n",
